ClickDealer is hiring a Senior Affiliate Manager
ClickDealer is one of the top-5 CPA networks worldwide! Since 2012, the company has been in performance marketing, partnering with over 2,000 advertisers across more than 40 verticals. HQ in the Netherlands, and over 5 offices across the globe.
If you've got 3+ years in affiliate marketing, fluent English, and know how to do more than "just run traffic" - building real partnerships and driving revenue growth - let's talk!
What we expect:

• 3+ years of experience in affiliate marketing, across several verticals (not locked into just one niche);

• Fluency in written and spoken English;

• Strong communication and negotiation skills;

• Comfortable working with large volumes of data and drawing insights from it;

• Ready to make bold calls and own the outcomes;

• Thrives in a fast-paced environment without cutting corners on quality.

What you'll be doing:

• Recruiting and growing top-tier affiliates, managing key accounts;

• Acting as the main point of contact, from contracts and negotiations to day-to-day support;

• Running multiple campaigns at once: budgets, payouts, creatives, offer updates;

• Monitoring traffic quality and volume, catching risks early;

• Keeping a pulse on market trends and sharing insights with the team;

• Owning revenue growth - monthly, quarterly, and annual targets.

We offer:

• Real growth opportunities in an international market;

• 20 paid vacation days + paid sick leave;

• 50% coverage for sports, therapy, courses, and language classes;

• Cross-team knowledge sharing - no unnecessary bureaucracy.

